{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About Animal Cafe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nestled in a magical forest, you play as a tiny animal chef serving cozy meals to woodland guests. Cook, serve, and create a warm haven for all who wander in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/2-\u9996\u9875gif-new.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully choose your cards and build unique culinary styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With nearly 200 specialty food cards from around the world, create diverse cooking strategies to boost customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/10-\u4e09\u9009\u4e00gif.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect matching food cards to trigger bonus rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards with similar flavors and ingredients can be linked together to earn extra satisfaction \u2014 experiment to discover more combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/11-line\u8fde\u7ebfgif.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pair your dishes with cookware and sauces to unlock even more combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different kitchen tools enhance card effects, while sauces let you tweak flavors \u2014 giving you endless possibilities in your culinary journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/13-\u5546\u57ce\u9053\u5177gif.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve guests with diverse tastes and meet more adorable animal friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make new friendships through food \u2014 welcome to Animal Cafe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/12-\u56fe\u9274gif.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443630?t=1749628750","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3443630?t=1749628750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/cdacb8b546c21342731fa2e3c270ded860abaa6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749628750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/cdacb8b546c21342731fa2e3c270ded860abaa6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749628750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About Animal Cafe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nestled in a magical forest, you play as a tiny animal chef serving cozy meals to woodland guests. Cook, serve, and create a warm haven for all who wander in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/2-\u9996\u9875gif-new.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carefully choose your cards and build unique culinary styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With nearly 200 specialty food cards from around the world, create diverse cooking strategies to boost customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/10-\u4e09\u9009\u4e00gif.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connect matching food cards to trigger bonus rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards with similar flavors and ingredients can be linked together to earn extra satisfaction \u2014 experiment to discover more combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/11-line\u8fde\u7ebfgif.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pair your dishes with cookware and sauces to unlock even more combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different kitchen tools enhance card effects, while sauces let you tweak flavors \u2014 giving you endless possibilities in your culinary journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/13-\u5546\u57ce\u9053\u5177gif.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve guests with diverse tastes and meet more adorable animal friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make new friendships through food \u2014 welcome to Animal Cafe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443630/extras/12-\u56fe\u9274gif.gif?t=1749628750\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","